## Protocol Comparison Matrix

| Feature | Li.Fi | Across | Socket/Bungee | Stargate V2 | Relay |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| **Native ETH** | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| **API Key** | No | Yes | No | No | Yes |
| **Returns Calldata** | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | Manual | ✅ |
| **Integration** | REST API | REST API | REST API | Contract | REST API |
| **Chain Support** | All EVM | All EVM | All EVM | All EVM | All EVM |
| **Speed** | Varies | ~2 sec | Varies | 1-5 min | Fast |
| **ETH Approval** | None | None | None | None | None |
| **Complexity** | Low | Low-Med | Low | Medium | Low-Med |

## Multi-Protocol Fallback Strategy

```
bridgeETH() →
  1. try Li.Fi (no API key, best aggregation)
  2. if fail: try Across (fastest fills)
  3. if fail: try Stargate V2 (direct contract)
  4. if fail: try Socket/Bungee (no API key)
  5. if fail: try Relay (intent-based)
  6. if all fail: show error to user
```

